  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Its very fun to play VRchat but due to my weak computer I pretty much always have to have avatars turned off. When I do have it on the game lags and when the and everyone sounds like they are in slow motion. I thought that maybe there should be a Poly slider in the settings that would allow avatars under a poly limit, that you set, to be seen. For example, if I only wanted to see avatars that are under or exactly 5000 polys, Only avatars that are under 5000 polys would be seen. The slider would not effect your friends. There should also be an option to allow friends to bypass your set poly slider limit. The slider would allow people to set a poly limit for avatars they want to see. Whether they set the poly limit to 1000 or the maximum poly count allowed. Please consider this idea or something like it because it gets a bit boring talking to grey default avatars. I have an image to give the idea.",
